                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 I just joined my colleagues in introducing the More Affordable Care Act (MACA).\u00a0\u00a0\n\u00a0\nThis legislation will give patients the freedom to shop for coverage, manage their own health care dollars, and make informed decisions that will lower costs.",
